  eventSystem: {fileID: 0}
  initalLines:
  - What are you doing here?
  - "How\u2019d you get here?"
  - Who sent you?
  - "My delivery isn\u2019t coming for a few days\u2026"
  - "You\u2019re here to learn my magic?"
  - "If you want to learn from me, you\u2019ll need to finish the great dirt maze
    using earth magic! Good luck with that"
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - You actually completed it?
  - Color me impressed.
  - "I guess I can humor you\u2026 if you can manage to best my magic!"
  afterBattleLines:
  - "You\u2019re stronger than I thought."
  afterSpellLines:
  - Dirt may be small, but it tells us so much about the land.
  - Pay mind to the small details, and your magic can become more powerful too.
